      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Been told to post on this canny if we still have TMP sorting issues. I've still had plenty of TMPs in my world (on open beta) that ignore the layering we set them to, both in-editor and in-game. It seems to respect the layering we're setting it to when viewed from certain angles, but those angles are only about 10-20% of the time, so it's mostly just an odd flicker that pops up at some times.\nThis layering issue also seems to be visible between sprites as well. In scenarios where the sprites render over each other correctly in live, the Open Beta makes the front sprite disappear behind the back sprite when viewed from right to left, but they're ordered correctly when viewed from left to right. If you want pictures, please reply (don't want to spam the comments)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
