      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: The public version of my world has both of them: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_1caa6d80-9ee4-4a7d-95ee-50259272aa35\nOn Desktop, press 'M' to open the menu, then click the top button and look at both the Equipment and Items buttons- the sprite to the left of the text disappears when viewed from right to left.\nMoving forward, if you actually click the Items button, you'll see that the 4th item's text (Curing Crystal) is still visible in front of the sprite mask even though the actual button sprite is blocked correctly. You can click and drag or use your scroll wheel to scroll that list and watch the 1st button scroll up, where its text is also still visible in front of the upper mask.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
