      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not sure if this has anything to do with anything, but in my scene view, all my buttons are fully expanded, when in-game you'd only ever have one button expanded at a time. I'm seeing some text that doesn't get blocked by the sprite mask unless there are *two* with the exact same settings over the text. Here's a video of that in action: https://streamable.com/qsf1y9\n* The sprite masks cover a custom range of Default -10 to Default 5\n* The text is a TMP with a Sorting Group setting to Default 0\nIt actually looks like this it the *only* issue I'm experiencing... I've verified the sprite clashing issue was because of my own mistakes with the layering settings.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
