  "details": "On the current Open Beta client the sorting layers for Text Mesh Pro seem to be ignored. In the Live Client they function fine. Attached is a screenshot showing 2 books. The left book has the Canvas's Sorting Layer set to -1 allowing the text to render, Text Mesh Pro sorting Layer is set to 0. The right book has a Canvas with a Sorting layer of 0 and a Text Mesh Pro Sorting Layer of 2. Some text missing depending on the viewing angle. \nThis means the Sorting Layer is fine for the Canvas but the Text has it defaulting to 0 even if we set it higher.",
